# Snapshot: examples/09_records

### Source: `examples/09_records.frog`

```frog
record Point
    x int
    y int
end

proc squared-distance Point -- int do
    let point do
        point @Point.x dup *
        point @Point.y dup *
        +
    end
end

proc main -- do
    Point:alloc
    let point do
        3 point !Point.x
        4 point !Point.y
        point squared-distance print
        Point:sizeof print
    end
end
```

### Run

Command:

```text
build/frogc run examples/09_records.frog
```

Output:

```text
25
16
```

